  "content": "\n\n<h1>更好的夜视</h1>\n<p>允许对夜视效果进行微调，例如完全禁用该效果，或将警告闪烁改为平滑淡出。</p>\n<p>如果您希望支持本项目，请考虑在 Ko-Fi 上为我捐款！</p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmicrocontrollers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-Fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fMicrocontrollersDev%252fBetterNightVision\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Codeberg\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/codeberg_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetternightvision\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n</a>",
